{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GirlsAward"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに髪の毛ぐりんぐりんに\nしたから思わずぐりんぐりんて\n落書きしちゃったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子のイベントだから\nぐりんぐりんにしたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐりんぐりんぐりんぐりんぐりん\nぐりんぐりん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"憧れのファッションイベントで\nライブ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪走れ！Bicycle\n♪おいでシャンプー\n♪会いたかったかもしれない\n↑ランウェイを使った\nスペシャルバージョン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの女の子の前でライブが\nできて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんとななせが歩く姿を\n生で見てました！\n2人ともきらきらしてて、\n本当にかわいかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルさんきれいだった...\n人種が違うよ！！もう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通にきゃーきゃー言ってしまったぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部がきらきらしてて、\n全部がかわいくて、\n女の子でよかった。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もファッションだいすきだから\nいつかファッション関係の\nお仕事したいです><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/09/4572810/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今撮影してます:D\n頑張りまりかー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}